==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*15 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*4 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can help you rush the base down fast. Additionally, [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] can help to deal fast damage to The Face that pops out as a boss at the start of the battle.

In {{4c}} difficulty, Awakened Bahamut is still viable and he makes the stage a breeze. Spawn him at the right time and he'll destroy everything in his path.

